minar on the importance of networking online. Before giving your presentation, you decide to post the main points of your presentation on your company blog and encourage comments. Which of the following actions will be most beneficial to both the audience and the presenter?</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow></flow><flow class="RESPONSE_BLOCK"><response_lid ident="response" rcardinality="Single" rtiming="No"><render_choice shuffle="No" minnumber="0" maxnumber="0"><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="1D3246CA356B4ACA8938AC3A82C2DBAC" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">Monitoring audience tweets about the presentation during the presentation.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="106713E4E5EF4CF59260C4C491362101" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">Posting the main points of your presentation on the company blog, viewing the comments after the presentation, and setting up a discussion forum to discuss the issues.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="CF7579C6AA334A2592ED9AA4AE55BA7F" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">Posting the main points of your presentation online, but disabling comments in order to encourage live audience feedback during the presentation.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="DB9D586E936F40E1AD09F77799DE50EB" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><ma